<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/><meta name="theme-color" content="#241b4b"/><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"/><title>Financial Planning for Contractors & Business Owners | RIPL Wealth</title><meta name="description" content="Financial planning for business owners. RIPL helps coordinate investments, tax-aware strategies and the professionals who support your financial life."/><meta property="og:type" content="website"/><meta property="og:title" content="Save on Taxes. Optimize Your Money. Build What’s Next."/><meta property="og:description" content="Straightforward, tax-aware wealth planning for business owners."/><meta property="og:image" content="https://ripl-money-at-work.akasick.workers.dev/social-preview.jpg"/><meta property="og:image:width" content="1200"/><meta property="og:image:height" content="630"/><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"/><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://ripl-money-at-work.akasick.workers.dev/social-preview.jpg"/><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg"/><link rel="preconnect" href="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com" crossorigin/><link rel="preconnect" href="https://www.youtube.com" crossorigin/><link rel="preconnect" href="https://i.ytimg.com" crossorigin/><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"/><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin/><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Libre+Baskerville:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/money-at-work/style.css"/></head><body>
