<main id="main"><section class="hero-v71 wrap" aria-labelledby="hero-title"><div class="hero-v71-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="line"></span> FINANCIAL PLANNING FOR BUSINESS OWNERS</p><h1 id="hero-title"><span>Save on taxes.</span><span>Optimize money.</span><em>Simple.</em></h1><p class="hero-v71-description">You know how to run your business. But who's making sure the money you've worked so hard to earn is working just as hard for you?</p><p class="hero-v71-description hero-gc">Think of RIPL as your financial general contractor—helping coordinate investments, tax-aware strategies, and the professionals who support your financial life.</p></div><div class="hero-visual"><div class="hero-v71-image"><img src="/money-at-work/images/adam-studio-hero.webp" width="1488" height="992" alt="Adam Kasick in his recording studio" fetchpriority="high"/></div><div class="hero-video-slot" data-video-container><button type="button" class="hero-video-link" data-video-id="ibtJjhboaiA" aria-label="Play Meet Adam introduction video on this page"><span aria-hidden="true">▶</span> Meet Adam · 1-minute introduction</button></div></div><div class="hero-v71-actions"><a class="button primary" href="https://calendly.com/adam-riplwealth/20-minute-zoom-meeting" data-book data-book-type="hero">Let's Talk →</a><p class="hero-quiz-note">Free 20-minute Zoom conversation · No obligation</p><a class="hero-secondary-cta" href="#quiz">Not ready to talk? Take the free Lazy Money Quiz →</a></div></section><section class="section wrap owner-situations" id="owner-situations"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">SOUND FAMILIAR?</p><h2>Good business. <em>Important money decisions.</em></h2><p>Whether you're building, saving, selling, or giving, it's easier to make decisions when the pieces fit together.</p></div><div class="situation-grid"><article><h3>“Everything goes back into the business.”</h3><p>How much capital should stay in the company, and how much may support your future outside it?</p><a href="https://calendly.com/adam-riplwealth/20-minute-zoom-meeting" data-book data-book-type="problem">Let's talk through it →</a></article><article><h3>“I've got too much cash.”</h3><p>What's needed for operating flexibility, and what could have a different long-term job?</p><a href="https://calendly.com/adam-riplwealth/20-minute-zoom-meeting" data-book data-book-type="problem">Let's talk through it →</a></article><article><h3>“I'm thinking about selling.”</h3><p>Which conversations with your tax, legal, and financial professionals should happen before the sale?</p><a href="https://calendly.com/adam-riplwealth/20-minute-zoom-meeting" data-book data-book-type="problem">Let's talk through it →</a></article></div></section>
<section class="section wrap" id="services"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">HOW RIPL HELPS</p><h2>One plan. <em>Connected decisions.</em></h2></div><div class="services">{[['01','Tax-aware planning','Your CPA records what happened. We help consider what happens next from the investment and planning side, working alongside your CPA.'],['02','Putting money to work','We build investment approaches around your goals, time horizon, liquidity needs and willingness to take risk—not a cookie-cutter portfolio.'],['03','Your financial general contractor','We help coordinate decisions involving your business, investments, and other professionals as your life changes.']].map(([n,title,description])=><article><span class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true">{n}</span><h3>{title}</h3><p>{description}</p></article>)}</div><p class="fine">Investing involves risk, including loss of principal. Tax outcomes depend on individual circumstances and are not guaranteed.</p></section><section class="section wrap about" id="about"><div class="about-photo family-photo"><img src="/money-at-work/images/adam-family-original.jpg" alt="Adam with his family" width="609" height="640" loading="lazy"/></div><div><p class="eyebrow">A LITTLE ABOUT ME</p><h2>Meet <em>Adam.</em></h2><p>When I'm not talking about money, there's a good chance I'm doing something competitive. Golf, pickleball, F1, and youth sports tend to get most of my attention.</p><p>I also love coaching youth sports. There's something pretty rewarding about helping a young athlete learn to compete, handle adversity, and realize they're capable of more than they thought.</p><p>But the most important parts of my life are my faith and my family. I'm a husband and dad, and my Christian faith plays an important role in how I try to live, serve people, and approach the work I do.</p><blockquote>“Successful people make great decisions when they can see their options clearly.”</blockquote><div class="credential"><strong>Experience you can verify</strong><p>Investment advisory services are provided through RIPL Wealth, LLC, a registered investment adviser. Adam has passed the Series 7 and Series 66 securities examinations. Client accounts are custodied through Altruist.</p><p><a href="https://adviserinfo.sec.gov/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Verify adviser registration ↗</a> <a href="https://brokercheck.finra.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Check BrokerCheck ↗</a></p></div></div></section><section class="section wrap explore" id="explore"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">EXPLORE FURTHER</p><h2>Not ready to talk? <em>Start here.</em></h2><p>Take our free seven-question quiz or explore more about how we think. No email required for quiz results.</p></div></section><section class="section wrap quiz-section" id="quiz"><div class="quiz-shell"><div class="quiz-header"><div><h2>Lazy money <em>quiz.</em></h2><p class="quiz-promise">No email. No obligation. Immediate results.</p></div></div><div id="quiz-progress" class="quiz-progress"><span id="step-label">Question 1 of 7</span><div class="track"><i id="progress-fill"></i></div></div><div id="quiz-content"><h3 class="question-title">{first.title}</h3><p class="hint">{first.hint}</p><div class="options">{first.options.map((a,i)=><button type="button" data-answer={i}>{a}</button>)}</div></div></div><section id="results" hidden aria-live="polite"></section></section>
<div class="wrap explore-details"><details><summary>Learn about direct indexing and structured notes</summary><section class="section tools-bg"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">TWO TOOLS WORTH KNOWING ABOUT</p><h2>Two strategies that might help you put your money to work more effectively.</h2></div><div class="tool-grid"><article><p class="tag">TAX-AWARE INVESTING</p><h3>Direct Indexing</h3><p>Instead of buying a fund, you own the individual stocks inside it. When some of them drop, we can sell those to capture a loss that may offset gains elsewhere, while keeping you invested in the market. Similar broad market exposure, with more control over how taxable gains and losses are managed.</p><p class="risk"><em>Tax-loss harvesting does not guarantee a better outcome, and tax benefits depend on your situation. Talk with your CPA. Direct indexing can differ from an index and may involve additional costs.</em></p></article><article><p class="tag">DEFINED-OUTCOME INVESTMENTS</p><h3>Structured Notes</h3><p>Some money needs to grow without taking every hit the market throws. Certain structured notes can be designed for potential income or growth, with a buffer against specified market declines up to a defined point. The terms spell out how potential payments and losses are calculated.</p><p class="risk"><em>Structured notes are subject to the issuer's credit risk, can lose principal if markets fall past the protection level, may limit upside, and may be difficult to sell before maturity. Payments are not guaranteed.</em></p></article></div></div></section>
</details><details><summary>Explore the optional $497 tax evaluation</summary><section class="section wrap start" id="start"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">OPTIONAL DEEPER REVIEW</p><h2>Have a specific tax question? <em>Explore an evaluation.</em></h2></div><article class="offer primary-offer" id="tax-evaluation"><span class="offer-kicker">OPTIONAL PAID SERVICE · DISCUSS SCOPE FIRST</span><h3>Tax evaluation.</h3><p>Let's begin with a quick email. Tell me you're interested in the tax evaluation, and I'll reply with what I need and how the process works. You can handle the initial questions by email or choose a 20-minute call—whatever's easier.</p><p>If we decide to review your tax return, I'll arrange secure document sharing separately. Hazel may help identify planning opportunities for us to discuss alongside your CPA. The $497 fee covers the tax evaluation, not tax preparation. We will confirm scope, payment instructions, and next steps before beginning any paid review. We work alongside your CPA; potential tax savings are not guaranteed.</p><div class="secure-info"><span aria-hidden="true">♧</span><p><strong>Email or call first. Share documents securely later.</strong> Do not attach tax returns, Social Security numbers, or other sensitive documents to an ordinary email or submit them on this website.</p></div><div class="tax-contact-actions"><a class="button outline" id="tax-email-link" href="mailto:adam@riplwealth.com?subject=Tax%20evaluation%20request&amp;body=Hi%20Adam%2C%0A%0AI%27m%20interested%20in%20the%20tax%20evaluation.%20Please%20send%20me%20the%20next%20steps.%0A%0A%28I%20won%27t%20attach%20my%20tax%20return%20to%20this%20email.%29" data-tax-email>Email Adam to get started →</a><a class="button outline" href="https://calendly.com/adam-riplwealth/20-minute-zoom-meeting" data-book data-book-type="call">Prefer to talk? Book a 20-minute call →</a></div><p class="placeholder-note" id="upload-note">Your initial email or introductory call does not itself purchase the evaluation. Adam will confirm the scope and arrange secure sharing and payment separately if you decide to proceed.</p></article></section>
</details></div><section class="section wrap library" id="videos"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">HOW WE THINK ABOUT MONEY</p><h2>Questions real <em>owners ask.</em></h2><p>Short videos about situations real business owners face. If one sounds familiar, bring it to our conversation.</p></div><div id="video-grid" class="video-grid">{featuredVideos.map(v=><article class="video-card" data-video-stage={v.stage}><div class="video-thumb" data-video-container>{v.youtubeId?<button class="video-play-button" type="button" data-video-id={v.youtubeId} aria-label={`Play ${v.title} on this page`}><img loading="lazy" src={`https://i.ytimg.com/vi/${v.youtubeId}/maxresdefault.jpg?v=20261029`} onerror={`this.onerror=null;this.src='https://i.ytimg.com/vi/${v.youtubeId}/hqdefault.jpg?v=20261029';`} alt=""/><span aria-hidden="true">▶</span></button>:<><img src="/money-at-work/images/adam.webp" loading="lazy" alt=""/><span>Soon</span></>}</div><div><h3>{v.title}</h3><p>{v.summary}</p>{!v.youtubeId&&<span class="video-soon">Video coming soon</span>}<p class="risk">{v.risk}</p></div></article>)}</div></section>
<section id="booking" class="booking"><div class="wrap booking-inner"><div><p class="eyebrow">LET'S SHARE SOME GOOD IDEAS</p><h2>20 minutes. <em>Let's find your next step.</em></h2><p>Bring a question about taxes, investments, business cash, or what comes next. We’ll talk through your priorities, the people already on your team, and whether a deeper review makes sense. This introductory conversation is free; a separate tax evaluation, if requested, is a paid service.</p></div><div class="booking-action"><a id="booking-link" class="button primary" href="https://calendly.com/adam-riplwealth/20-minute-zoom-meeting" data-book data-book-type="call">Let's Talk — Free 20-Minute Zoom →</a><p id="booking-note" class="placeholder-note">We'll use this conversation to clarify your next step.</p></div></div></section>
